        "explanation": "The doctor gave a traceable short-interval handoff to transplant clinic.",
        "quote": "预约到了3天后的移植门诊"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00156",
        "explanation": "The caregiver confirmed the key medication plan and follow-up preparation.",
